<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ reports NZ$295.9 mln trade deficit in Sept.</title>
<headline>NZ reports NZ$295.9 mln trade deficit in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Thursday released the following provisional statistics for New Zealand external merchandise trade for September.</p>
<p>(Figures are rounded)</p>
<p>Monthly series:</p>
<p>		Sept 1996	   Aug 1996	     Sept 1995</p>
<p>Balance    -$295.9 million   -$374.4 million    -$257.3 million</p>
<p>Exports     $1.53 billion     $1.66 bln	    $1.58 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.83 billion     $2.03 bln	    $1.84 bln</p>
<p>		Yr-to-Sept 1996  Yr-to-Aug 1996    Yr-to-Sept 1995</p>
<p>Balance    -$704.2 million	 -$665.6 million	  -$557.1 million</p>
<p>Exports     $20.87 bln	  $20.92 bln	   $20.97 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $21.57 bln	  $21.58 bln	   $21.53 bln</p>
<p>Trend series:</p>
<p>		 Sept 1996	  Aug 1996	    Sept 1995</p>
<p>Balance    -$49.8 million	  -$37.1 million	   -$24.4 million</p>
<p>Exports     $1.78 billion     $1.78 bln	    $1.75 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.83 billion     $1.82 bln	    $1.77 bln</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
